0.1.6
-----
- Added SEN() for analytical sensitivities of Lee-Carter parameters, mortality forecasts, and actuarial values
- Enhanced mortality curve fitting algorithms
- Expanded vignette

0.1.5
-----
- Added mortalitymatrix() for data format conversion
- Added optimisation diagnostics to fitted curve objects
- Expanded test suite and vignette

0.1.4
-----
- Added model fitting with Poisson assumption
- Added LCLS() for fitting Lee-Carter model with sparse data in irregular years

0.1.3
-----
- Added CFM2S() for multi-population modelling
- Added CAES() for multi-population modelling
- Added ENI() for ensemble interval
- Added S3 method simulate()

0.1.2
-----
- Updated documentation
- Improved fitting for Van der Maen curve
- Restricted CBD-related models to ages 50–90
- Added ENS() for ensemble forecasting
- Added CFMS() for multi-population modelling
